
<section class="section-heading"><div><h2>Your front door to the grid</h2><p>Design a welcoming page and keep the website’s working Member Login.</p></div></section>
<div class="two-column"><section class="studio-panel"><span class="step">01 · CHOOSE A PAGE</span><h2>Front login page</h2><p>Activate a published public page containing one visible Member Login component. The default page remains available if a custom page goes offline.</p><form method="post"><?php $hidden('front_apply')?><label>Published login page<select name="pageId"><option value="">Default login page</option><?php foreach(ag_pd_list_pages() as $p):if(empty($p['published'])||($p['access'] ?? '')!=='public'||ag_sa_page_login_count($p)!==1)continue;?><option value="<?=ag_h($p['id'])?>" <?=$state['frontPage']===$p['id']?'selected':''?>><?=ag_h($p['title'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><button>Activate front page</button><a class="button secondary" href="/Other/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open current front page ↗</a></form></section>
<section class="studio-panel"><span class="step">02 · MAKE IT YOURS</span><h2>Build or edit in Page Designer</h2><p>Create a page, add the Member Login component, and arrange your pictures and welcome text around it.</p><a class="button" href="/Other/admin-page-designer.php">Open Page Designer ↗</a><form method="post"><?php $hidden('add_login')?><label>Add Member Login to a saved page<select name="pageId" required><?php foreach($pages as $p):if(!isset($p['builder']))continue;?><option value="<?=ag_h($p['id'])?>"><?=ag_h($p['title'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><button class="secondary">Add to private draft</button></form></section></div>
<section class="studio-panel"><span class="step">OR · START WITH YOUR OWN DESIGN</span><h2>Import an HTML website</h2><p>Upload a ZIP containing HTML, CSS and images. The existing importer converts supported content into editable Page Designer elements. Custom scripts and form handlers are replaced by native components; review the converted layout before publishing.</p>
<?php if($stage):?><form method="post"><?php $hidden('template_import')?><input type="hidden" name="token" value="<?=ag_h($stage['token'])?>"><label>Page to import<select name="htmlFile"><?php foreach($stage['pages'] as $file):?><option><?=ag_h($file)?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><?php foreach($stage['notices'] as $notice):?><p><?=ag_h($notice)?></p><?php endforeach ?><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="1" required> I have permission to use this template and will review the imported draft.</label><button>Import as a private draft</button></form>
<?php else: ?><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?php $hidden('template_upload')?><label>Website template ZIP<input type="file" name="templateZip" accept=".zip,application/zip" required></label><button>Review ZIP contents</button></form><?php endif ?></section>
<?php if($pages):?><section class="studio-panel"><h2>Your saved pages</h2><div class="page-list"><?php foreach($pages as $p):?><article><div><strong><?=ag_h($p['title'])?></strong><div class="accessibility"><?php foreach(ag_sd_accessibility(ag_sd_active_theme($state,'public'),$p) as $warning):?><p><?=ag_h($warning)?></p><?php endforeach ?></div><span><?=!empty($p['published'])?'Published':'Private draft'?><?=!empty($p['hasDraft'])?' · Draft changes':''?></span></div><div><a class="button secondary" href="/Other/site-front-preview.php?id=<?=ag_h($p['id'])?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Preview</a><a class="button secondary" href="/Other/admin-page-designer.php?id=<?=ag_h($p['id'])?>">Edit</a></div></article><?php endforeach ?></div></section><?php endif ?>
